nt specifically for the column header.</p>\n","type":"TextAlign","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#headertextalign"},"hideAtMedia":{"name":"hideAtMedia","description":"<p>Adjusts column visibility based on <a href=\"http://cssmediaqueries.com/what-are-css-media-queries.html\">Media Queries</a>. Accepts valid media query strings.</p>\n","type":"string","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#hideatmedia"},"isFrozen":{"name":"isFrozen","description":"<p>Freezes the column if set to <code>true</code>.</p>\n","type":"boolean","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#isfrozen"},"isIdentity":{"name":"isIdentity","description":"<p>Marks the column as an identity column if set to <code>true</code>.</p>\n","type":"boolean","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#isidentity"},"isPrimaryKey":{"name":"isPrimaryKey","description":"<p>Designates this column as a primary key if set to <code>true</code>.</p>\n","type":"boolean","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#isprimarykey"},"lockColumn":{"name":"lockColumn","description":"<p>Locks the column to its position, preventing reordering, if set to <code>true</code>. Locked columns appear first.</p>\n","type":"boolean","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#lockcolumn"},"maxWidth":{"name":"maxWidth","description":"<p>Maximum width of the column in pixels or percentage, preventing resizing beyond this value.</p>\n","type":"string|number","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#maxwidth"},"minWidth":{"name":"minWidth","description":"<p>Minimum width of the column in pixels or percentage.</p>\n","type":"string|number","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/treegrid/treeGridColumn#minwidth"},"showCheckbox":{"name":"showChe