ndexed","description":"<p>Allows to specify the indexed category to the axis.</p>\n","type":"boolean","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/pivotview/pivotAxis#isindexed"},"isInversed":{"name":"isInversed","description":"<p>Allows to specify whether the axis to be rendered in inversed manner or not.</p>\n","type":"boolean","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/pivotview/pivotAxis#isinversed"},"labelFormat":{"name":"labelFormat","description":"<p>It used to format the axis label that accepts any global string format like 'C', 'n1', 'P' etc.\nIt also accepts placeholder like '{value}°C' in which value represent the axis label, e.g, 20°C.</p>\n","type":"string","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/pivotview/pivotAxis#labelformat"},"labelIntersectAction":{"name":"labelIntersectAction","description":"<p>Allows to set the actions like <code>Hide</code>, <code>Rotate45</code>, and <code>Rotate90</code> when the axis labels intersect with each other.They are,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Rotate45: Rotates the label to 45 degree when it intersects.</li>\n<li>Rotate90: Rotates the label to 90 degree when it intersects.</li>\n<li>None: Shows all the labels.</li>\n<li>Hide: Hides the label when it intersects.</li>\n</ul>\n","type":"LabelIntersectAction","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/pivotview/pivotAxis#labelintersectaction"},"labelPlacement":{"name":"labelPlacement","description":"<p>Allows to set the placement of a label for category axis. They are,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>onTicks: Renders the label on the ticks.</li>\n<li>betweenTicks: Renders the label between the ticks.</li>\n</ul>\n","type":"LabelPlacement","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/pivotview/pivotAxis#labelplacement"},"labelPosition":{"name":"labelPosition","description":"<p>Allows to set the placement of a labels to the axis line. They are,</p>\n<ul>\n<li>outside: Renders the labels outside to the axis line.</li>\n<li>inside