ust be forward forecasted.</p>\n","type":"number","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#forwardforecast"},"intercept":{"name":"intercept","description":"<p>Specifies the intercept value of the trendline.</p>\n","type":"number","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#intercept"},"legendShape":{"name":"legendShape","description":"<p>The <code>legendShape</code> property defines the shape used to represent the trendline in the chart legend.</p>\n","type":"string","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#legendshape"},"marker":{"name":"marker","description":"<p>Options for customizing the markers for trendlines, including shape, size, color, and other visual aspects.</p>\n","type":"MarkerSettingsModel","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#marker"},"name":{"name":"name","description":"<p>The <code>name</code> property is used to assign a descriptive name to the trendline, which will be displayed in the chart as a legend.</p>\n","type":"string","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#name"},"period":{"name":"period","description":"<p>Defines the period, the price changes over which will be considered to predict the moving average trendline.</p>\n","type":"number","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#period"},"polynomialOrder":{"name":"polynomialOrder","description":"<p>Defines the polynomial order of the polynomial trendline.</p>\n","type":"number","link":"//ej2.syncfusion.com/javascript/documentation/api/chart/trendline#polynomialorder"},"type":{"name":"type","description":"<p>Defines the type of trendline used in the series.\nAvailable types are:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Linear - A straight line that shows the general direction of data.</li>\n<li>Exponential - A curve that fits data with exponential growth or decay.</li>\n<li>Polynomial - A curve that fits data with a poly